sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Challenger
  participant P as Policy Contract
  participant V as Authorized Verifier
  participant C as Custodian Committee
  participant R as Re-execution Engine
  U->>P: Dispute(record_id, reason, bond)
  P->>P: Validate window and policy
  P-->>V: Authorization token, deadline
  V->>V: Fetch ciphertext and encapsulated key
  V-->>C: Confidential partial-decryption request
  C-->>V: Verified partial decryptions
  V->>V: Combine at least t partials, recover K_r
  V->>R: Decrypted inference record
  R-->>P: Deterministic verdict / proof artifact
  P-->>U: Settlement, bond result, fault evidence
